<div class="wrap pt-5"><nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="text-sm text-ink-700 "><ol class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-2 gap-y-1"><li class="flex items-center gap-2"><a class="underline-offset-4 hover:underline" href="{{ routes.root_url }}">Home</a><span aria-hidden="true" class="text-brass">/</span></li><li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span aria-current="page" class="text-ink-900">How it's made</span></li></ol></nav></div>
<section class="wrap grid gap-10 pt-8 pb-16 lg:grid-cols-[1.1fr_0.9fr] lg:items-center"><div><h1 class="font-display text-5xl leading-[1.02] sm:text-6xl lg:text-7xl">How our ghee is made</h1><div class="mt-6"><aside data-speakable="true" class="rounded-r-2xl border-l-4 border-ghee-500 bg-oat px-5 py-4 sm:px-6 sm:py-5"><p class="text-sm font-semibold text-ghee-800">How is Farm Dip ghee made?</p><p class="mt-1 text-lg leading-relaxed">Farm Dip ghee is made the bilona way from full-fat buffalo milk. The milk is heated slowly to a gentle boil, covered and set into dahi for 8 to 12 hours, then churned until the butter separates. The butter is collected, washed in cold water, clarified into ghee, cooled for 10 to 15 minutes and strained through muslin. Nothing is added.</p></aside></div></div><div data-pausable="" class="mx-auto aspect-[4/5] w-full max-w-sm overflow-hidden rounded-[2rem]"><div class="journey-sky relative size-full" style="--sky-a:#f08c4a;--sky-b:#fcd69a"><svg viewBox="0 0 400 400" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMax slice" class="absolute inset-0 size-full" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><defs><linearGradient id="churn-clay" x1="0" x2="1"><stop offset="0" stop-color="#7a3418"></stop><stop offset="0.45" stop-color="#d27c44"></stop><stop offset="1" stop-color="#6e2e14"></stop></linearGradient><clipPath id="churn-rod"><rect x="193" y="64" width="14" height="186" rx="4"></rect></clipPath></defs><circle cx="62" cy="140" r="28" fill="#fff1c4" opacity="0.9"></circle><path d="M0 330H400V400H0Z" fill="#b9773f"></path><rect x="300" y="0" width="22" height="336" fill="#7a4220"></rect><path d="M305 0V336M314 0V336" stroke="#5e3018" stroke-width="1.2"></path><path d="M206 98H302" stroke="#c9a26a" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round"></path><ellipse cx="200" cy="98" rx="11" ry="4" fill="none" stroke="#c9a26a" stroke-width="4"></ellipse><path d="M120 256C76 290 84 370 130 392C160 404 240 404 270 392C316 370 324 290 280 256Z" fill="url(#churn-clay)" stroke="#4a1e0c" s